<title>PHILIPPINES: Philrealty to develop 205.52 ha property.</title>
<headline>Philrealty to develop 205.52 ha property.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine Realty &amp; Holdings Corp (Philrealty) said on Tuesday it had signed a memorandum of agreement with A Brown Co and two other groups to develop a 205.52 hectare property just outside Manila.</p>
<p>A Brown Co, together with unlisted Campos, Lanuza &amp; Co Inc and Geoex Holdings Corp, are owners of contiguous parcels of land in Tanay, Rizal, east of Manila.</p>
<p>No other details were available.</p>
<p>Philrealty rose four centavos to 1.38 pesos by late session, while A Brown was unchanged at 2.90 pesos.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
